  "term": "emotional deterioration",
  "definition": "Emotional deterioration is a worsening in a person’s emotional valence over time, meaning their moment-to-moment feelings shift in a more negative direction during an ongoing interaction. In the source packet, it refers to this negative emotional shift being more likely after low-quality AI responses.",
